'''By Gun and Sword''' (銃刀法, ''Jūtōhō'', '''Firearms and Swords Control Law''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (M): Knockback distance increases by 20%.

